        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-The guns have stopped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "C-Can we go now? Not upwards, but down, before the bombs reach us\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get up, Yuri, and the rest of you. We need to find Rankin and the place he was talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know the bravest ones of us have all left with Rankin, to take the outpost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bombing's stopped, and we don't know what's going on up there. The only way to find them is up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "Either we save them, or, as Rankin said, remember them. Crawl, pull yourselves on with your pickaxes, if you can't walk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Rankin gave us his mining lamp\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember what he said?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He... he didn't say anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. He didn't say anything. This is no different from the supplies that they left behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or we can choose to leave it here... as a reminder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, reminder. Leave the lamp in the mining cart, the one that we pushed all the way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If anyone ever comes through...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember that you can write, Yuri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_papertear",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got some blank pages at the back of the logbook. We might as well not waste it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come here. I'll tell you what to write.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "If anyone comes, at least they'll know what happened here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worried Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
