    {
        "text": "<p=1>A mine, Northern Tundra, Ursus</><p=2>Winter, 1101</>",
        "tag": "animtext",
        "id": "at1",
        "name": "group_location_stamp",
        "style": "avg_both",
        "pos": "-400,-200",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "animtextclean"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_094",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, where... where are we going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sick Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think the factory's this way\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sick Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up and keep walking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "I said walk!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) The mines have stopped again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) So, nothing for the processing plants to work with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Where would they take us, if they don't need hands upstairs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1970_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They dragged even the sickest ones out of their beds. Half the mine is here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fearful Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to keep walking. I don't want to die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fearful Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Shh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go through the forest, to the lake. That's where you'll meet your end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't even think...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "About running away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heavy military boots step on the snowy forest floor, moving forward, urging forward."
    },
    {
        "text": "The miners are being escorted by far more than just a few men."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
