    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The saber cuts her throat, spilling hot blood on the soldier's armor."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the glory of Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_094"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Bozhe moy</i>...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sick Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Proceed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-Next! Fill the gap! Hurry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_surfacefrozen",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "sur"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "sur",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do we have to be treated like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up, you <i>uyobok</i>\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were the Tsar's promises all a lie? Are our lives worth less than that of a burdenbeast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1978_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Army Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the soldier is about to raise his hand again, the rumbling of the ground becomes perceptible."
    },
    {
        "text": "It starts with a tiny crack, from the surface, from deep below, before snowballing quickly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "e"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 4,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "e",
        "fadetime": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_surfacefrozen",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The ground trembles, and the center of the lake collapses. The result of geological changes accumulated over time swallows the Infected on the ice, and their would-be executioners."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1969_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skeptical Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The miner shakes off the stunned soldier and runs in the direction they came from."
    },
    {
        "text": "Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a Catastrophe!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
