    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The youth bids his classmate farewell and goes into the mines, ready to get to work."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mine tunnels left untended gradually wear down and eventually collapse. He will not allow it to happen, as long as he is still here."
    },
    {
        "text": "The young man raises his mining lamp and begins his rounds, examining all the rail, until he finds a mining cart at one of the forks that does not belong to this place."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "This is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "A mining lamp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "And a letter\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "This was once the place of a struggle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it. The people who proposed connecting the mining districts were here! They wanted to occupy that garrisoned outpost!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew the story was true...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
