    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoever's lamp this was, it's in good condition. Maybe a little dusty, but it still works...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I should take it to Grypherburg\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "And show everyone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "This lamp without a name, and those people without names.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Craftsman"
    },
